      "filename": "Ternate, Maluku Islands, Indonesia 2.jpg",
      "title": "File:Ternate, Maluku Islands, Indonesia 2.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Ternate%2C_Maluku_Islands%2C_Indonesia_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ternate,_Maluku_Islands,_Indonesia_2.jpg",
      "width": 2042,
